{% comment %}
  Marketing collaborations page (templates/page.colaborari-marketing.json). A "creator"
  page, deliberately unlike the showroom, company and B2B pages:

  - Hero: headline + a fan of three phone screens (reels shot in the showroom) with a
    "new customer via your link" notification.
  - The four collaboration formats as tabs (assets/alc-collab.js), a bento of what the
    partner gets (the product count is live), vertical content-idea cards, and the
    application: three steps next to a form that goes to the store's contact inbox,
    tagged "Colaborare marketing" so it can be filtered.

  Every storefront language has a built-in translation. Styles: assets/alc-collab.css.
{% endcomment %}
