    when 'de'
      assign w = "Marketing-Kooperationen|Sie gestalten.|Wir bringen das Licht.|Wir arbeiten mit Content Creators, Bloggern, YouTube-Kanälen und Newslettern, die schöne Produkte einem echten Publikum zeigen möchten. Sie wählen das Format, wir bringen die Produkte, die Materialien und die Vergütung.|Für eine Kooperation bewerben|Schreiben Sie uns auf WhatsApp|@ihr.profil|Das Wohnzimmer, vorher und nachher|Neuer Kunde über Ihren Link|Prämie gutgeschrieben|Formate|Wählen Sie, wie Sie mit uns zusammenarbeiten möchten.|Was Sie tun|Was Sie bekommen|Ideal für|Affiliate und Blog|Sie schreiben über Einrichtung, Beleuchtung oder Interior Design? Empfehlen Sie unsere Produkte über Ihren Link und verdienen Sie an jedem geworbenen Kunden.|Artikel, Ratgeber und Produktvergleiche mit Links zu unserem Shop.|Eine Prämie für jeden Kunden, der über Ihren Link kauft.|Blogs, Nischenseiten, Kaufratgeber|Social Media|Sie erstellen Inhalte auf Instagram, TikTok oder Facebook? Zeigen Sie Ihren Followern, wie das richtige Licht einen ganzen Raum verwandelt.|Reels, Kurzvideos, Stories und Beiträge mit unseren Produkten bei Ihnen zu Hause.|Die Produkte für Ihre Inhalte und eine gemeinsam vereinbarte Vergütung.|Instagram, TikTok, Facebook|YouTube-Kanal|Sie haben einen YouTube-Kanal? Tests und Einrichtungsprojekte werden noch Monate und Jahre nach der Veröffentlichung angesehen.|Tests, Unboxings, Montage Schritt für Schritt und Renovierungsprojekte.|Die Produkte zum Filmen, technische Informationen und eine langfristige Zusammenarbeit.|Tests, DIY, Einrichtung, Renovierung|Newsletter|Sie haben eine Abonnentenliste? Nehmen Sie Alessandro Design Produkte in Ihre Empfehlungen und Angebote auf.|Produktauswahlen und Angebote für Ihre Abonnenten.|Versandfertige Bilder und Texte sowie die vereinbarte Prämie.|Newsletter, Communitys, Einkaufsclubs|Warum mit uns|Alles, was Sie für Inhalte brauchen, die gut aussehen.|Produkte, die vor der Kamera glänzen|Kronleuchter, Wandleuchten, LED-Spiegel und Design-Badausstattung, die vor der Kamera genauso gut aussehen wie zu Hause.|Ein Showroom als Filmset|Showroom und Lager mit über 5.000 m² in Afumați, Rumänien. Wir vereinbaren einen Tag, und Sie filmen zwischen leuchtenden Lampen.|Materialien zum sofortigen Einsatz|Fotos, Videos, Datenblätter und Texte zu jedem Produkt.|Eine Prämie für jeden Kunden|Jeder Kunde, den Sie bringen, wird je nach gewähltem Format belohnt.|Ein fester Ansprechpartner|Sie sprechen direkt mit unserem Marketingteam, von der Idee bis zur Veröffentlichung.|Publikum in mehreren Ländern|Wir liefern in mehrere europäische Länder, Sie können also mit uns zusammenarbeiten, wo auch immer Ihre Community ist.|Produkte im Katalog|Content-Ideen|Sie wissen nicht, wo Sie anfangen sollen? Fangen Sie hier an.|Vorher und nachher: das Wohnzimmer|Unboxing: ein Kristallkronleuchter|Rundgang durch den Showroom|Montage Schritt für Schritt|Das Bad, mit leuchtendem LED-Spiegel|So wählen Sie das Licht für jeden Raum|So starten wir|Drei Schritte bis zum ersten Beitrag.|Sie bewerben sich|Sie füllen das Formular aus. Das dauert zwei Minuten.|Wir klären die Details|Wir melden uns und wählen gemeinsam Produkte, Format und Vergütung.|Sie veröffentlichen|Sie gestalten die Inhalte in Ihrem Stil. Wir helfen bei allem, was die Produkte betrifft.|Bewerbung|Erzählen Sie uns, wer Sie sind.|Ein paar Angaben zu Ihnen und Ihren Inhalten. Unser Marketingteam meldet sich bald.|Name|E-Mail|Hauptplattform|Etwas anderes|Link zu Ihrem Profil oder Ihrer Website|Reichweite (Follower oder Abonnenten)|Nachricht|Erzählen Sie uns kurz von Ihren Inhalten und was Sie gerne erstellen möchten.|Bewerbung senden|Vielen Dank!|Wir haben Ihre Bewerbung erhalten. Unser Marketingteam meldet sich bald bei Ihnen.|Bitte prüfen Sie Ihre E-Mail-Adresse und versuchen Sie es erneut.|Wir verwenden Ihre Daten nur, um Sie wegen der Kooperation zu kontaktieren.|Lieber WhatsApp?|Schreiben Sie uns direkt|Hallo! Ich würde gerne bei der Werbung für Alessandro Design Produkte zusammenarbeiten.|.|Blog / Website|jetzt|Pflichtfeld"
    else
      assign w = "Colaborări de marketing|Tu creezi.|Noi aducem lumina.|Lucrăm cu creatori de conținut, bloggeri, canale de YouTube și newslettere care vor să arate produse frumoase unei audiențe reale. Alegi formatul, noi venim cu produsele, materialele și recompensa.|Aplică pentru colaborare|Scrie-ne pe WhatsApp|@creatorul.tau|Livingul, înainte și după|Client nou prin linkul tău|Recompensă adăugată|Formate|Alege cum vrei să colaborăm.|Ce faci|Ce primești|Potrivit pentru|Afiliere și blog|Scrii despre amenajări, iluminat sau design interior? Recomanzi produsele noastre prin linkul tău și câștigi din fiecare client adus.|Articole, ghiduri și topuri de produse, cu linkuri către magazinul nostru.|O recompensă pentru fiecare client care cumpără prin linkul tău.|Bloguri, site-uri de nișă, ghiduri de cumpărături|Social media|Ești creator pe Instagram, TikTok sau Facebook? Arată-le urmăritorilor cum schimbă lumina potrivită o cameră întreagă.|Reels, clipuri scurte, stories și postări cu produsele noastre, în casa ta.|Produsele pentru content și o recompensă stabilită împreună.|Instagram, TikTok, Facebook|Canal de YouTube|Ai un canal de YouTube? Recenziile și proiectele de amenajare sunt văzute luni și ani după publicare.|Recenzii, unboxing, montaj pas cu pas și proiecte de renovare.|Produsele pentru filmare, informații tehnice și o colaborare pe termen lung.|Recenzii, DIY, amenajări, renovări|Newsletter|Ai o listă de abonați? Adaugă produse Alessandro Design în selecțiile și ofertele tale.|Selecții de produse și oferte trimise abonaților tăi.|Imagini și texte gata de trimis, plus recompensa agreată.|Newslettere, comunități, cluburi de cumpărături|De ce cu noi|Tot ce îți trebuie pentru un content care arată bine.|Produse care arată bine în cadru|Lustre, aplice, oglinzi LED și obiecte sanitare cu design, gândite să arate la fel de bine pe cameră ca în casă.|Un showroom ca platou de filmare|Showroom și depozit de peste 5.000 m² în Afumați. Stabilim o zi și filmezi printre lumini aprinse.|Materiale gata de folosit|Fotografii, clipuri, fișe tehnice și texte pentru fiecare produs.|Recompensă pentru fiecare client|Fiecare client adus de tine e răsplătit, după formatul ales.|Un om de contact|Vorbești direct cu echipa de marketing, de la idee până la publicare.|Audiență din mai multe țări|Livrăm în mai multe țări din Europa, așa că poți colabora cu noi oriunde ar fi comunitatea ta.|produse în catalog|Idei de content|Nu știi de unde să începi? Începe de aici.|Înainte și după: livingul|Unboxing: o lustră de cristal|Tur prin showroom|Montaj pas cu pas|Baia, cu oglinda LED aprinsă|Cum alegi lumina pentru fiecare cameră|Cum începem|Trei pași până la primul material.|Aplici|Completezi formularul. Durează două minute.|Stabilim detaliile|Te contactăm și alegem împreună produsele, formatul și recompensa.|Publici|Creezi conținutul în stilul tău. Noi te ajutăm cu tot ce ține de produse.|Aplică|Spune-ne cine ești.|Câteva detalii despre tine și conținutul tău. Echipa de marketing îți răspunde cât de curând.|Nume|Email|Platforma principală|Altceva|Link către profil sau site|Audiență (urmăritori sau abonați)|Mesaj|Povestește-ne pe scurt despre conținutul tău și ce ți-ar plăcea să creezi.|Trimite aplicația|Mulțumim!|Am primit aplicația ta. Echipa de marketing te contactează în curând.|Verifică adresa de email și încearcă din nou.|Folosim datele tale doar ca să te contactăm despre colaborare.|Preferi WhatsApp?|Scrie-ne direct|Salut! Aș vrea să colaborăm pentru promovarea produselor Alessandro Design.|.|Blog / site|acum|Câmp obligatoriu"
  endcase
  assign t = w | split: '|'

  assign reveal = ''
  if settings.animations_reveal_on_scroll
    assign reveal = ' scroll-trigger animate--slide-in'
  endif

  comment
    Live catalogue size, rounded down to the hundred: "3.300+".
  endcomment
  assign n = collections.all.products_count | divided_by: 100 | times: 100
  assign n_thousands = n | divided_by: 1000
  assign n_rest = n | modulo: 1000 | plus: 1000 | append: '' | slice: 1, 3
  if n_thousands > 0
    assign product_count = n_thousands | append: t[85] | append: n_rest | append: '+'
  else
    assign product_count = n | append: '+'
  endif

  assign wa_number = section.settings.whatsapp | remove: '+' | remove: ' '
  assign wa_msg = t[84] | url_encode | replace: '+', '%20'
  assign wa_url = 'https://wa.me/' | append: wa_number | append: '?text=' | append: wa_msg

  comment
    Product photos for the catalogue card and the content ideas: available products
    with a photo from the chosen collection (Lustre LED by default).
  endcomment
  assign pool = section.settings.collection | default: collections['lustre-led']
  assign picks = pool.products | where: 'available'

  comment
    The unboxing idea shows a crystal chandelier.
  endcomment
  assign crystal = blank
  for p in collections['candelabre-cristal'].products
    if p.available and p.featured_image
      assign crystal = p
      break
    endif
  endfor

  comment
    Formats: [icon, first copy index]. Each format has name, text, do, get, for.
  endcomment
  assign formats = 'pen:15,camera:20,video:25,mail:30' | split: ','

  comment
    Values stored in the email the team receives stay in Romanian, whatever the
    storefront language, so every application reads the same.
  endcomment
  assign platforms_ro = 'Instagram|TikTok|YouTube|Facebook|Blog / site|Newsletter|Altceva' | split: '|'
  assign audiences = '< 10k|10k – 50k|50k – 200k|200k +' | split: '|'
-%}

<div class="alc-cl">
  {%- comment -%} Hero {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="alc-cl__hero">
    <div class="page-width alc-cl__hero-grid">
      <div class="alc-cl__hero-copy">
        <p class="alc-cl__pill"><span class="alc-cl__pill-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>{{ t[0] }}</p>
        <h1 class="alc-cl__h1">
          {{- t[1] }} <span class="alc-cl__glow-text">{{ t[2] }}</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="alc-cl__lead">{{ t[3] }}</p>
        <div class="alc-cl__actions">
          <a class="alc-cl__btn alc-cl__btn--ink" href="#AlcCollabApply">
            {{- t[4] -}}
            {%- render 'alc-cl-icon', name: 'arrow' -%}
          </a>
          <a class="alc-cl__btn alc-cl__btn--ghost" href="{{ wa_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            {%- render 'alc-ds-icon', name: 'whatsapp' -%}
            {{- t[5] -}}
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} Decorative: it repeats what the copy says, so screen readers skip it. {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="alc-cl__stage" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="alc-cl__halo"></span>
        {%- for pos in (1..3) -%}
          {%- liquid
            case pos
              when 1
                assign ph_class = 'l'
                assign ph_img = section.settings.phone_1
                assign ph_asset = 'alc-showroom-detail.jpg'
                assign ph_likes = '8,9k'
                assign ph_comments = '214'
              when 2
                assign ph_class = 'c'
                assign ph_img = section.settings.phone_2
                assign ph_asset = 'alc-showroom-crystal.jpg'
                assign ph_likes = '24,1k'
                assign ph_comments = '1.208'
              else
                assign ph_class = 'r'
                assign ph_img = section.settings.phone_3
                assign ph_asset = 'alc-showroom-mirrors.jpg'
                assign ph_likes = '5,3k'
                assign ph_comments = '97'
            endcase
          -%}
          <div class="alc-cl__phone alc-cl__phone--{{ ph_class }}">
            <div class="alc-cl__screen">
              {%- if ph_img != blank -%}
                {{
                  ph_img
                  | image_url: width: 640
                  | image_tag: widths: '320, 480, 640', sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 240px, 45vw', loading: 'eager', alt: '', class: 'alc-cl__screen-img'
                }}
              {%- else -%}
                <img
                  class="alc-cl__screen-img"
                  src="{{ ph_asset | asset_img_url: '640x' }}"
                  srcset="{{ ph_asset | asset_img_url: '360x' }} 360w, {{ ph_asset | asset_img_url: '640x' }} 640w"
                  sizes="(min-width: 990px) 240px, 45vw"
                  width="640"
                  height="480"
                  alt=""
                  loading="eager"
                >
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if pos == 2 -%}
                <span class="alc-cl__bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
              {%- endif -%}
              <span class="alc-cl__rail">
                <span>{%- render 'alc-cl-icon', name: 'heart' -%}<small>{{ ph_likes }}</small></span>
                <span>{%- render 'alc-cl-icon', name: 'comment' -%}<small>{{ ph_comments }}</small></span>
                <span>{%- render 'alc-cl-icon', name: 'send' -%}</span>
              </span>
              <span class="alc-cl__meta">
                <span class="alc-cl__who"><i></i>{{ t[6] }}</span>
                {%- if pos == 2 -%}<span class="alc-cl__cap">{{ t[7] }}</span>{%- endif -%}
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>
        {%- endfor -%}

        <div class="alc-cl__toast">
          <span class="alc-cl__toast-icon">{%- render 'alc-cl-icon', name: 'spark' -%}</span>
          <span class="alc-cl__toast-text">
            <strong>{{ t[8] }}</strong>
            <span>{{ t[9] }} · {{ t[87] }}</span>
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} Formats, as tabs {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="page-width alc-cl__block">
    <header class="alc-cl__head">
      <p class="alc-cl__eyebrow">{{ t[10] }}</p>
      <h2 class="alc-cl__h2">{{ t[11] }}</h2>
    </header>

    <alc-cl-tabs class="alc-cl__tabs{{ reveal }}">
      <div class="alc-cl__tablist" role="tablist" aria-label="{{ t[10] | escape }}">
        {%- for f in formats -%}
          {%- assign parts = f | split: ':' -%}
          {%- assign fi = parts[1] | plus: 0 -%}
          <button
            type="button"
            class="alc-cl__tab"
            role="tab"
            id="AlcClTab-{{ forloop.index }}"
            aria-controls="AlcClPanel-{{ forloop.index }}"
            aria-selected="{% if forloop.first %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
            {% unless forloop.first %}
              tabindex="-1"
            {% endunless %}
          >
            {%- render 'alc-cl-icon', name: parts[0] -%}
            <span>{{ t[fi] }}</span>
          </button>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>

      {%- for f in formats -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign parts = f | split: ':'
          assign fi = parts[1] | plus: 0
          assign fd = fi | plus: 1
          assign fdo = fi | plus: 2
          assign fget = fi | plus: 3
          assign ffor = fi | plus: 4
        -%}
        <div
          class="alc-cl__panel"
          role="tabpanel"
          id="AlcClPanel-{{ forloop.index }}"
          aria-labelledby="AlcClTab-{{ forloop.index }}"
          tabindex="0"
          {% unless forloop.first %}
            hidden
          {% endunless %}
        >
          <div class="alc-cl__panel-intro">
            <span class="alc-cl__panel-icon" aria-hidden="true">{%- render 'alc-cl-icon', name: parts[0] -%}</span>
            <h3 class="alc-cl__panel-title">{{ t[fi] }}</h3>
            <p class="alc-cl__panel-text">{{ t[fd] }}</p>
          </div>
          <dl class="alc-cl__facts">
            <div>
              <dt>{{ t[12] }}</dt>
              <dd>{{ t[fdo] }}</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>{{ t[13] }}</dt>
              <dd>{{ t[fget] }}</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>{{ t[14] }}</dt>
              <dd>{{ t[ffor] }}</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </alc-cl-tabs>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} What the partner gets {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="page-width alc-cl__block">
    <header class="alc-cl__head">
      <p class="alc-cl__eyebrow">{{ t[35] }}</p>
      <h2 class="alc-cl__h2">{{ t[36] }}</h2>
    </header>

    <div class="alc-cl__bento"{% if reveal != blank %} data-cascade{% endif %}>
      <article class="alc-cl__card alc-cl__card--count{{ reveal }}" style="--animation-order: 1;">
        <p class="alc-cl__count">{{ product_count }}</p>
        <p class="alc-cl__count-label">{{ t[49] }}</p>
        <h3 class="alc-cl__card-title">{{ t[37] }}</h3>
        <p class="alc-cl__card-text">{{ t[38] }}</p>
        {%- if picks.size > 3 -%}
          <div class="alc-cl__thumbs">
            {%- for p in picks limit: 4 -%}
              <span>
                {{-
                  p.featured_image
                  | image_url: width: 240
                  | image_tag: widths: '120, 240', sizes: '120px', loading: 'lazy', alt: ''
                -}}
              </span>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </article>

      <article class="alc-cl__card alc-cl__card--set{{ reveal }}" style="--animation-order: 2;">
        {%- assign set_img = section.settings.set_image -%}
        {%- if set_img != blank -%}
          {{
            set_img
            | image_url: width: 1400
            | image_tag: widths: '600, 900, 1200, 1400', sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 640px, 100vw', loading: 'lazy', alt: '', class: 'alc-cl__card-bg'
          }}
        {%- else -%}
          <img
            class="alc-cl__card-bg"
            src="{{ 'alc-showroom-hall.jpg' | asset_img_url: '1200x' }}"
            srcset="{{ 'alc-showroom-hall.jpg' | asset_img_url: '600x' }} 600w, {{ 'alc-showroom-hall.jpg' | asset_img_url: '1200x' }} 1200w"
            sizes="(min-width: 990px) 640px, 100vw"
            width="1200"
            height="675"
            alt=""
            loading="lazy"
          >
        {%- endif -%}
        <span class="alc-cl__card-icon">{%- render 'alc-cl-icon', name: 'film' -%}</span>
        <h3 class="alc-cl__card-title">{{ t[39] }}</h3>
        <p class="alc-cl__card-text">{{ t[40] }}</p>
      </article>

      {%- for i in (1..4) -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign ti = i | times: 2 | plus: 39
          assign di = ti | plus: 1
          case i
            when 1
              assign icon = 'image'
            when 2
              assign icon = 'gift'
            when 3
              assign icon = 'user'
            else
              assign icon = 'globe'
          endcase
          assign order = i | plus: 2
        -%}
        <article class="alc-cl__card{% if i > 2 %} alc-cl__card--wide{% endif %}{{ reveal }}" style="--animation-order: {{ order }};">
          <span class="alc-cl__card-icon">{%- render 'alc-cl-icon', name: icon -%}</span>
          <h3 class="alc-cl__card-title">{{ t[ti] }}</h3>
          <p class="alc-cl__card-text">{{ t[di] }}</p>
        </article>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} Content ideas, as vertical video cards {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="alc-cl__block alc-cl__ideas-wrap">
    <div class="page-width">
      <header class="alc-cl__head">
        <p class="alc-cl__eyebrow">{{ t[50] }}</p>
        <h2 class="alc-cl__h2">{{ t[51] }}</h2>
      </header>
      <ul class="alc-cl__ideas" role="list"{% if reveal != blank %} data-cascade{% endif %}>
        {%- for i in (1..6) -%}
          {%- liquid
            assign ti = i | plus: 51
            assign idea_asset = blank
            assign idea_src = blank
            case i
              when 1
                assign idea_src = picks[4].featured_image | default: picks[0].featured_image
                assign dur = '0:42'
              when 2
                assign idea_src = crystal.featured_image | default: picks[1].featured_image
                assign dur = '1:15'
              when 3
                assign idea_asset = 'alc-showroom-exterior.jpg'
                assign dur = '3:08'
              when 4
                assign idea_src = picks[6].featured_image | default: picks[2].featured_image
                assign dur = '8:24'
              when 5
                assign idea_asset = 'alc-showroom-bath.jpg'
                assign dur = '0:28'
              else
                assign idea_src = picks[7].featured_image | default: picks[3].featured_image
                assign dur = '5:51'
            endcase
          -%}
          <li class="alc-cl__idea{{ reveal }}" style="--animation-order: {{ i }};">
            {%- if idea_asset != blank -%}
              <img
                src="{{ idea_asset | asset_img_url: '600x' }}"
                srcset="{{ idea_asset | asset_img_url: '360x' }} 360w, {{ idea_asset | asset_img_url: '600x' }} 600w"
                sizes="(min-width: 990px) 200px, 56vw"
                width="600"
                height="600"
                alt=""
                loading="lazy"
              >
            {%- elsif idea_src != blank -%}
              {{
                idea_src
                | image_url: width: 600
                | image_tag: widths: '360, 600', sizes: '(min-width: 990px) 200px, 56vw', loading: 'lazy', alt: ''
              }}
            {%- endif -%}
            <span class="alc-cl__idea-dur">{{ dur }}</span>
            <span class="alc-cl__idea-play" aria-hidden="true">{%- render 'alc-cl-icon', name: 'play' -%}</span>
            <h3 class="alc-cl__idea-title">{{ t[ti] }}</h3>
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} Apply: the steps next to the form {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="alc-cl__apply" id="AlcCollabApply">
    <div class="page-width alc-cl__apply-grid">
      <div class="alc-cl__apply-copy">
        <p class="alc-cl__eyebrow">{{ t[58] }}</p>
        <h2 class="alc-cl__h2">{{ t[59] }}</h2>
        <ol class="alc-cl__steps" role="list">
          {%- for i in (1..3) -%}
            {%- assign ti = i | minus: 1 | times: 2 | plus: 60 -%}
            {%- assign di = ti | plus: 1 -%}
            <li class="alc-cl__step">
              <span class="alc-cl__step-num" aria-hidden="true">{{ i }}</span>
              <div>
                <h3 class="alc-cl__step-title">{{ t[ti] }}</h3>
                <p class="alc-cl__step-text">{{ t[di] }}</p>
              </div>
            </li>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ol>
        <p class="alc-cl__alt">
          {{ t[82] }}
          <a href="{{ wa_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            {%- render 'alc-ds-icon', name: 'whatsapp' -%}
            {{- t[83] -}}
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="alc-cl__form-card{{ reveal }}">
        {%- form 'contact', id: 'AlcCollabForm', class: 'alc-cl__form' -%}
          {%- if form.posted_successfully? -%}
            <div class="alc-cl__success" tabindex="-1" autofocus>
              <span class="alc-cl__success-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12.5l4.2 4.2L19 7"/></svg>
              </span>
              <h2 class="alc-cl__form-title">{{ t[78] }}</h2>
              <p class="alc-cl__form-sub">{{ t[79] }}</p>
            </div>
          {%- else -%}
            <p class="alc-cl__eyebrow">{{ t[66] }}</p>
            <h2 class="alc-cl__form-title">{{ t[67] }}</h2>
            <p class="alc-cl__form-sub">{{ t[68] }}</p>

            {%- if form.errors -%}
              <p class="alc-cl__alert" role="alert" tabindex="-1" autofocus>{{ t[80] }}</p>
            {%- endif -%}

            <input type="hidden" name="contact[Formular]" value="Colaborare marketing">
            <input type="hidden" name="contact[Piata]" value="{{ request.host | remove_first: 'www.' }} ({{ request.locale.iso_code }})">

            <div class="alc-cl__row">
              <div class="alc-cl__field">
                <label class="alc-cl__label" for="AlcCollabForm-name">{{ t[69] }}</label>
                <input
                  class="alc-cl__input"
                  type="text"
                  id="AlcCollabForm-name"
                  name="contact[name]"
                  autocomplete="name"
                  value="{% if form.name %}{{ form.name }}{% elsif customer %}{{ customer.name }}{% endif %}"
                >
              </div>
              <div class="alc-cl__field">
                <label class="alc-cl__label" for="AlcCollabForm-email">
                  {{- t[70] }} <span aria-hidden="true">*</span></label
                >
                <input
                  class="alc-cl__input"
                  type="email"
                  id="AlcCollabForm-email"
                  name="contact[email]"
                  autocomplete="email"
                  spellcheck="false"
                  autocapitalize="off"
                  required
                  aria-required="true"
                  value="{% if form.email %}{{ form.email }}{% elsif customer %}{{ customer.email }}{% endif %}"
                  {% if form.errors contains 'email' %}
                    aria-invalid="true"
                  {% endif %}
                >
              </div>
            </div>

            <fieldset class="alc-cl__group">
              <legend class="alc-cl__label">{{ t[71] }}</legend>
              <div class="alc-cl__chips">
                {%- for p in platforms_ro -%}
                  <label class="alc-cl__chip">
                    <input type="radio" name="contact[Platforma]" value="{{ p }}">
                    <span>
                      {%- case forloop.index -%}
                        {%- when 5 -%}
                          {{- t[86] -}}
                        {%- when 7 -%}
                          {{- t[72] -}}
                        {%- else -%}
                          {{- p -}}
                      {%- endcase -%}
                    </span>
                  </label>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </div>
            </fieldset>

            <div class="alc-cl__field">
              <label class="alc-cl__label" for="AlcCollabForm-link">{{ t[73] }}</label>
              <input
                class="alc-cl__input"
                type="text"
                id="AlcCollabForm-link"
                name="contact[Profil]"
                inputmode="url"
                autocomplete="url"
                autocapitalize="off"
                spellcheck="false"
                placeholder="instagram.com/…"
              >
            </div>

            <fieldset class="alc-cl__group">
              <legend class="alc-cl__label">{{ t[74] }}</legend>
              <div class="alc-cl__chips">
                {%- for a in audiences -%}
                  <label class="alc-cl__chip">
                    <input type="radio" name="contact[Audienta]" value="{{ a }}">
                    <span>{{ a }}</span>
                  </label>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </div>
            </fieldset>

            <div class="alc-cl__field">
              <label class="alc-cl__label" for="AlcCollabForm-body">{{ t[75] }}</label>
              <textarea
                class="alc-cl__input alc-cl__textarea"
                id="AlcCollabForm-body"
                name="contact[body]"
                rows="4"
                placeholder="{{ t[76] | escape }}"
              >
                {{- form.body -}}
              </textarea>
            </div>

            <div class="alc-cl__submit">
              <button type="submit" class="alc-cl__btn alc-cl__btn--ink alc-cl__btn--wide">
                {{- t[77] -}}
                {%- render 'alc-cl-icon', name: 'arrow' -%}
              </button>
              <p class="alc-cl__note"><span aria-hidden="true">*</span> {{ t[88] }} · {{ t[81] }}</p>
            </div>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endform -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "ALC marketing collabs",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section alc-cl-section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "whatsapp", "label": "WhatsApp number (international, digits only)", "default": "40725665925" },
    { "type": "collection", "id": "collection", "label": "Products for the catalogue card and content ideas", "info": "Empty: Lustre LED" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "phone_1", "label": "Left phone image", "info": "Empty: showroom detail" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "phone_2", "label": "Middle phone image", "info": "Empty: showroom crystal" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "phone_3", "label": "Right phone image", "info": "Empty: showroom mirrors" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "set_image", "label": "Showroom card image", "info": "Empty: showroom hall" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "ALC marketing collabs" }]
}
{% endschema %}
